      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "## When to use\nUse when working in a Powerhouse reactor package project and the Vetra development environment is not running or needs restarting \u2014 starting Vetra Studio and Switchboard, capturing their endpoints, initializing a new reactor package, or shutting one down.\n\n## What it covers\n- Quick reference\n- Readiness markers\n- References\n- Common mistakes\n- RPPM.00.1 Inspect existing projects\n- RPPM.00.2 Generate unique project name\n- RPPM.00.3 Initialize the project\n- RPPM.01.1 Start the Reactor Package project and wait until it's ready\n- RPPM.01.2 Parse and verify the Vetra endpoints\n- RPPM.02.1 Verify project is running\n- RPPM.02.2 Shutdown the project\n\n## Where the full skill lives\n- Vault source: **Agent skill: reactor-project** (full text, DERIVED_FROM below) \u2014 the vault is this skill's home.\n- Upstream origin: https://github.com/powerhouse-inc/powerhouse-dev-skills/tree/main/skills/reactor-project\n\n## Invocation\nRead the vault source content and follow it. Not a plugin command.\n\n_Added via add-skill; content hash sha256:a7894825117e\u2026_",
